{"format":"mandarin-paket","version":1,"id":"hsk-h3-01","typ":"text","titel":"搬家 · Der Umzug","thema":"HSK 3","beschreibung":"Lesetext HSK 3, 16 Sätze.","saetze":[{"nr":1,"w":[["上","Shàng"],["个","ge"],["月","yuè"],["，"],["我","wǒ"],["和","hé"],["丈夫","zhàng fu"],["从","cóng"],["城市","chéng shì"],["的","de"],["北边","běi bian"],["搬","bān"],["到","dào"],["了","le"],["南边","nán bian"],["。"]],"de":"Letzten Monat sind mein Mann und ich vom Norden der Stadt in den Süden gezogen.","audio":"audio/01.mp3","langsam":"audio/01-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":2,"w":[["以前","Yǐ qián"],["的","de"],["房子","fáng zi"],["离","lí"],["公司","gōng sī"],["太","tài"],["远","yuǎn"],["了","le"],["，"],["每天","měi tiān"],["坐","zuò"],["地铁","dì tiě"],["要","yào"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["多","duō"],["小时","xiǎo shí"],["。"]],"de":"Die alte Wohnung war zu weit von der Firma, jeden Tag brauchte ich mit der U-Bahn über eine Stunde.","audio":"audio/02.mp3","langsam":"audio/02-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":3,"w":[["新","Xīn"],["房子","fáng zi"],["在","zài"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["安静","ān jìng"],["的","de"],["街道","jiē dào"],["上","shàng"],["，"],["附近","fù jìn"],["有","yǒu"],["超市","chāo shì"],["、"],["银行","yín háng"],["和","hé"],["公园","gōng yuán"],["。"]],"de":"Die neue Wohnung liegt an einer ruhigen Strasse, in der Nähe gibt es einen Supermarkt, eine Bank und einen Park.","audio":"audio/03.mp3","langsam":"audio/03-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":4,"w":[["搬家","Bān jiā"],["那天","nà tiān"],["，"],["我们","wǒ men"],["早上","zǎo shang"],["六","liù"],["点","diǎn"],["就","jiù"],["起床","qǐ chuáng"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Am Umzugstag sind wir schon um sechs aufgestanden.","audio":"audio/04.mp3","langsam":"audio/04-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":5,"w":[["我们","Wǒ men"],["家","jiā"],["的","de"],["东西","dōng xi"],["特别","tè bié"],["多","duō"],["，"],["有","yǒu"],["冰箱","bīng xiāng"],["、"],["空调","kōng tiáo"],["、"],["桌子","zhuō zi"],["、"],["椅子","yǐ zi"],["，"],["还有","hái yǒu"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["书","shū"],["。"]],"de":"Wir hatten besonders viele Sachen: Kühlschrank, Klimaanlage, Tische, Stühle und noch viele Bücher.","audio":"audio/05.mp3","langsam":"audio/05-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":6,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["丈夫","zhàng fu"],["的","de"],["两","liǎng"],["个","ge"],["同事","tóng shì"],["来","lái"],["帮忙","bāng máng"],["。"]],"de":"Zwei Arbeitskollegen meines Mannes kamen helfen.","audio":"audio/06.mp3","langsam":"audio/06-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":7,"w":[["他们","Tā men"],["搬","bān"],["东西","dōng xi"],["搬","bān"],["得","de"],["很","hěn"],["快","kuài"],["，"],["但是","dàn shì"],["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["小心","xiǎo xīn"],["。"]],"de":"Sie trugen die Sachen schnell, aber auch sehr vorsichtig.","audio":"audio/07.mp3","langsam":"audio/07-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":8,"w":[["新","Xīn"],["房子","fáng zi"],["在","zài"],["八","bā"],["层","céng"],["，"],["还好","hái hǎo"],["楼","lóu"],["里","lǐ"],["有","yǒu"],["电梯","diàn tī"],["。"]],"de":"Die neue Wohnung ist im achten Stock, zum Glück hat das Haus einen Lift.","audio":"audio/08.mp3","langsam":"audio/08-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":9,"w":[["中午","Zhōng wǔ"],["，"],["大家","dà jiā"],["都","dōu"],["又","yòu"],["累","lèi"],["又","yòu"],["饿","è"],["。"]],"de":"Am Mittag waren alle müde und hungrig.","audio":"audio/09.mp3","langsam":"audio/09-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":10,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["去","qù"],["附近","fù jìn"],["的","de"],["饭馆","fàn guǎn"],["买","mǎi"],["了","le"],["面条","miàn tiáo"],["和","hé"],["啤酒","pí jiǔ"],["。"]],"de":"Ich habe im Restaurant in der Nähe Nudeln und Bier geholt.","audio":"audio/10.mp3","langsam":"audio/10-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":11,"w":[["吃","Chī"],["完","wán"],["饭","fàn"],["，"],["我们","wǒ men"],["开始","kāi shǐ"],["打扫","dǎ sǎo"],["房间","fáng jiān"],["。"]],"de":"Nach dem Essen begannen wir, die Zimmer zu putzen.","audio":"audio/11.mp3","langsam":"audio/11-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":12,"w":[["下午","Xià wǔ"],["五","wǔ"],["点","diǎn"],["，"],["东西","dōng xi"],["终于","zhōng yú"],["都","dōu"],["放","fàng"],["好","hǎo"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Um fünf Uhr war endlich alles eingeräumt.","audio":"audio/12.mp3","langsam":"audio/12-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":13,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["丈夫","zhàng fu"],["站","zhàn"],["在","zài"],["新","xīn"],["家","jiā"],["的","de"],["中间","zhōng jiān"],["，"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["这里","zhè li"],["比","bǐ"],["以前","yǐ qián"],["的","de"],["家","jiā"],["大","dà"],["多","duō"],["了","le"],["！"],["”"]],"de":"Mein Mann stand mitten in der neuen Wohnung und sagte lachend: «Hier ist es viel grösser als in der alten Wohnung!»","audio":"audio/13.mp3","langsam":"audio/13-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":14,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["满意","mǎn yì"],["，"],["因为","yīn wèi"],["从","cóng"],["这儿","zhèr"],["到","dào"],["公司","gōng sī"],["只","zhǐ"],["要","yào"],["十五","shí wǔ"],["分钟","fēn zhōng"],["。"]],"de":"Ich bin auch sehr zufrieden, denn von hier brauche ich nur fünfzehn Minuten zur Arbeit.","audio":"audio/14.mp3","langsam":"audio/14-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":15,"w":[["晚上","Wǎn shang"],["，"],["我们","wǒ men"],["请","qǐng"],["两","liǎng"],["个","ge"],["同事","tóng shì"],["去","qù"],["饭馆","fàn guǎn"],["吃饭","chī fàn"],["，"],["谢谢","xiè xie"],["他们","tā men"],["的","de"],["帮助","bāng zhù"],["。"]],"de":"Am Abend haben wir die beiden Kollegen zum Essen eingeladen, um ihnen für die Hilfe zu danken.","audio":"audio/15.mp3","langsam":"audio/15-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":16,"w":[["搬家","Bān jiā"],["虽然","suī rán"],["很","hěn"],["累","lèi"],["，"],["但是","dàn shì"],["我们","wǒ men"],["都","dōu"],["很","hěn"],["高兴","gāo xìng"],["。"]],"de":"Der Umzug war zwar anstrengend, aber wir sind sehr froh.","audio":"audio/16.mp3","langsam":"audio/16-langsam.mp3"}],"woerter":{"上":{"py":"Shàng","art":"Ortswort/V","de":"auf, oben; vorig; hinaufgehen","herl":"Strich über der Grundlinie. 桌子上 = auf dem Tisch, 上个月 = letzten Monat.","audio":"audio/w/1.mp3"},"个":{"py":"ge","art":"ZW","de":"allgemeines Zählwort","herl":"Steht zwischen Zahl/这/那 und Nomen: 三个人. Wird im Deutschen nicht übersetzt.","audio":"audio/w/2.mp3"},"月":{"py":"yuè","art":"N","de":"Monat; Mond","herl":"Bild einer Mondsichel. 七月 = Juli.","audio":"audio/w/3.mp3"},"我":{"py":"wǒ","art":"Pron","de":"ich","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Hellebarde (Waffe 戈 mit gezackter Klinge). Wurde wegen des gleichen Lauts für «ich» entlehnt.","audio":"audio/w/4.mp3"},"和":{"py":"hé","art":"Konj/Präp","de":"und; mit","herl":"Verbindet Nomen (爸爸和妈妈), keine Sätze. 和朋友去 = mit Freunden gehen.","audio":"audio/w/5.mp3"},"丈夫":{"py":"zhàng fu","art":"N","de":"Ehemann","herl":"丈 Mann + 夫 Mann.","audio":"audio/w/6.mp3"},"从":{"py":"cóng","art":"Präp","de":"von, aus","herl":"Zwei Menschen hintereinander: folgen. 从瑞士 = aus der Schweiz.","audio":"audio/w/7.mp3"},"城市":{"py":"chéng shì","art":"N","de":"Stadt","herl":"城 Stadtmauer + 市 Markt.","audio":"audio/w/8.mp3"},"的":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"Besitz- und Attributpartikel («-s», «von»)","herl":"白 weiss + 勺 Löffel; ursprünglich «hell, klar». Heute grammatisch: 我的 = mein, 好吃的菜 = feines Essen.","audio":"audio/w/9.mp3"},"北边":{"py":"běi bian","art":"Ortswort","de":"Norden, nördliche Seite","herl":"北 Norden + 边 Seite.","audio":"audio/w/10.mp3"},"搬":{"py":"bān","art":"V","de":"tragen, verschieben; umziehen","herl":"扌 Hand + 般 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/11.mp3"},"到":{"py":"dào","art":"V","de":"ankommen; bis","herl":"至 ankommen + 刂 (Lautteil). 到北京 = in Peking ankommen.","audio":"audio/w/12.mp3"},"了":{"py":"le","art":"Part","de":"(abgeschlossene Handlung, Veränderung)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: Handlung ist geschehen (我买了). Am Satzende: neue Lage (下雨了 = jetzt regnet es).","audio":"audio/w/13.mp3"},"南边":{"py":"nán bian","art":"Ortswort","de":"Süden, südliche Seite","herl":"南 Süden + 边 Seite.","audio":"audio/w/14.mp3"},"以前":{"py":"Yǐ qián","art":"N","de":"früher, vorher","herl":"以 + 前 vorn. 来中国以前 = bevor ich nach China kam.","audio":"audio/w/15.mp3"},"房子":{"py":"fáng zi","art":"N","de":"Haus, Wohnung","herl":"房 Haus + 子.","audio":"audio/w/16.mp3"},"离":{"py":"lí","art":"Präp","de":"entfernt von","herl":"A离B远 = A ist weit von B: 我家离公司不远.","audio":"audio/w/17.mp3"},"公司":{"py":"gōng sī","art":"N","de":"Firma","herl":"公 öffentlich + 司 leiten, Amt.","audio":"audio/w/18.mp3"},"太":{"py":"tài","art":"Adv","de":"zu, allzu; sehr","herl":"太…了 = toll! oder zu viel: 太好了 = super, 太贵了 = zu teuer.","audio":"audio/w/19.mp3"},"远":{"py":"yuǎn","art":"Adj","de":"weit, fern","herl":"辶 gehen + 元 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/20.mp3"},"每天":{"py":"měi tiān","art":"N","de":"jeden Tag","herl":"每 jeder + 天 Tag.","audio":"audio/w/21.mp3"},"坐":{"py":"zuò","art":"V","de":"sitzen; fahren mit","herl":"Zwei 人 auf der Erde 土. 坐车 = mit dem Auto/Bus fahren.","audio":"audio/w/22.mp3"},"地铁":{"py":"dì tiě","art":"N","de":"U-Bahn","herl":"地 Erde + 铁 Eisen: «Eisenbahn unter der Erde».","audio":"audio/w/23.mp3"},"要":{"py":"yào","art":"Hilfsverb/V","de":"wollen; müssen; brauchen; werden","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Taille, später «wollen». 我要茶 = Ich will Tee.","audio":"audio/w/24.mp3"},"一":{"py":"yí","art":"Zahl","de":"eins, ein","herl":"Ein Strich. Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton yí (一个), sonst yì (一些), allein yī.","audio":"audio/w/25.mp3"},"多":{"py":"duō","art":"Adj","de":"viel, viele; mehr","herl":"Zwei 夕 (Abend) übereinander: «viele Abende». 多吃 = mehr essen.","audio":"audio/w/26.mp3"},"小时":{"py":"xiǎo shí","art":"N","de":"Stunde","herl":"小 klein + 时 Zeit.","audio":"audio/w/27.mp3"},"新":{"py":"Xīn","art":"Adj","de":"neu","herl":"亲 + 斤 Axt: frisch gehauenes Holz.","audio":"audio/w/28.mp3"},"在":{"py":"zài","art":"V/Präp","de":"sich befinden; in, an; gerade (tun)","herl":"Ortsangabe steht vor dem Verb: 在学校工作. Vor Verben auch «gerade»: 我在看书.","audio":"audio/w/29.mp3"},"安静":{"py":"ān jìng","art":"Adj","de":"ruhig, still","herl":"安 friedlich + 静 still.","audio":"audio/w/30.mp3"},"街道":{"py":"jiē dào","art":"N","de":"Strasse","herl":"街 Strasse + 道 Weg.","audio":"audio/w/31.mp3"},"附近":{"py":"fù jìn","art":"N","de":"Nähe, in der Nähe","herl":"附 angrenzen + 近 nah.","audio":"audio/w/32.mp3"},"有":{"py":"yǒu","art":"V","de":"haben; es gibt","herl":"Hand 𠂇 hält ein Stück Fleisch (月 = 肉): etwas besitzen. Verneint mit 没: 没有.","audio":"audio/w/33.mp3"},"超市":{"py":"chāo shì","art":"N","de":"Supermarkt","herl":"超 übertreffen + 市 Markt: Kurzform von 超级市场.","audio":"audio/w/34.mp3"},"银行":{"py":"yín háng","art":"N","de":"Bank","herl":"银 Silber + 行 Geschäft.","audio":"audio/w/35.mp3"},"公园":{"py":"gōng yuán","art":"N","de":"Park","herl":"公 öffentlich + 园 Garten.","audio":"audio/w/36.mp3"},"搬家":{"py":"Bān jiā","art":"V","de":"umziehen","herl":"搬 tragen + 家 Wohnung.","audio":"audio/w/37.mp3"},"那天":{"py":"nà tiān","art":"N","de":"jener Tag","herl":"那 jenes + 天 Tag.","audio":"audio/w/38.mp3"},"我们":{"py":"wǒ men","art":"Pron","de":"wir","herl":"我 ich + 们 Mehrzahl für Personen.","audio":"audio/w/39.mp3"},"早上":{"py":"zǎo shang","art":"N","de":"Morgen, früh am Morgen","herl":"早 früh + 上. 早上好 = guten Morgen.","audio":"audio/w/40.mp3"},"六":{"py":"liù","art":"Zahl","de":"sechs","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild eines Daches, als Zahl entlehnt.","audio":"audio/w/41.mp3"},"点":{"py":"diǎn","art":"ZW/N","de":"Uhr (Uhrzeit); Punkt","herl":"灬 Feuer + 占 (Lautteil): ursprünglich schwarzer Fleck. 三点 = drei Uhr.","audio":"audio/w/42.mp3"},"就":{"py":"jiù","art":"Adv","de":"schon, gleich; genau","herl":"Betont Schnelligkeit oder Folge: 十分钟就到了 = in nur zehn Minuten da.","audio":"audio/w/43.mp3"},"起床":{"py":"qǐ chuáng","art":"V","de":"aufstehen","herl":"起 aufstehen + 床 Bett.","audio":"audio/w/44.mp3"},"家":{"py":"jiā","art":"N","de":"Familie, Zuhause; ZW für Firmen","herl":"宀 Dach + 豕 Schwein: ein Haus mit Vieh galt als Heim. 在家 = zu Hause.","audio":"audio/w/45.mp3"},"东西":{"py":"dōng xi","art":"N","de":"Sachen, Dinge","herl":"东 Osten + 西 Westen: «alles von Ost bis West». 买东西 = einkaufen.","audio":"audio/w/46.mp3"},"特别":{"py":"tè bié","art":"Adv/Adj","de":"besonders","herl":"特 besonders + 别 anders.","audio":"audio/w/47.mp3"},"冰箱":{"py":"bīng xiāng","art":"N","de":"Kühlschrank","herl":"冰 Eis + 箱 Kiste.","audio":"audio/w/48.mp3"},"空调":{"py":"kōng tiáo","art":"N","de":"Klimaanlage","herl":"空 Luft + 调 regeln.","audio":"audio/w/49.mp3"},"桌子":{"py":"zhuō zi","art":"N","de":"Tisch","herl":"桌 Tisch + 子 Nomensuffix.","audio":"audio/w/50.mp3"},"椅子":{"py":"yǐ zi","art":"N","de":"Stuhl","herl":"椅 Stuhl (木 Holz) + 子 Nomensuffix.","audio":"audio/w/51.mp3"},"还有":{"py":"hái yǒu","art":"Konj","de":"ausserdem, und noch","herl":"还 noch + 有 haben.","audio":"audio/w/52.mp3"},"很":{"py":"hěn","art":"Adv","de":"sehr","herl":"Vor Adjektiven oft nur Bindeglied: 天气很好 = Das Wetter ist gut.","audio":"audio/w/53.mp3"},"书":{"py":"shū","art":"N","de":"Buch","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Hand mit Pinsel: schreiben.","audio":"audio/w/54.mp3"},"两":{"py":"liǎng","art":"Zahl","de":"zwei (vor Zählwörtern)","herl":"两个人 = zwei Personen. Beim Zählen: 二.","audio":"audio/w/55.mp3"},"同事":{"py":"tóng shì","art":"N","de":"Arbeitskollege","herl":"同 gleich + 事 Arbeit.","audio":"audio/w/56.mp3"},"来":{"py":"lái","art":"V","de":"kommen","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Weizenähre, als Laut entlehnt. Bewegung zum Sprecher hin.","audio":"audio/w/57.mp3"},"帮忙":{"py":"bāng máng","art":"V","de":"helfen","herl":"帮 helfen + 忙 Beschäftigung. 帮我的忙 = mir helfen.","audio":"audio/w/58.mp3"},"他们":{"py":"Tā men","art":"Pron","de":"sie (Mehrzahl)","herl":"他 er + 们.","audio":"audio/w/59.mp3"},"得":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"(Art und Weise)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: 唱得很好 = singt sehr gut. Als 觉得 Teil von «finden».","audio":"audio/w/60.mp3"},"快":{"py":"kuài","art":"Adj","de":"schnell","herl":"忄 Herz + 夬: schnell, froh.","audio":"audio/w/61.mp3"},"但是":{"py":"dàn shì","art":"Konj","de":"aber","herl":"但 nur + 是.","audio":"audio/w/62.mp3"},"也":{"py":"yě","art":"Adv","de":"auch","herl":"Steht immer vor dem Verb: 我也喜欢.","audio":"audio/w/63.mp3"},"小心":{"py":"xiǎo xīn","art":"Adj","de":"vorsichtig","herl":"小 klein + 心 Herz: «mit kleinem, feinem Herzen».","audio":"audio/w/64.mp3"},"八":{"py":"bā","art":"Zahl","de":"acht","herl":"Zwei Striche, die sich trennen.","audio":"audio/w/65.mp3"},"层":{"py":"céng","art":"ZW","de":"Stockwerk","herl":"尸 + 云. 八层 = achter Stock.","audio":"audio/w/66.mp3"},"还好":{"py":"hái hǎo","art":"Ausdruck","de":"zum Glück; nicht schlecht","herl":"还 noch + 好 gut.","a